**How to add it on GitHub:**
1. Go to → **https://github.com/buxrdan/gamgarden-checkout**
2. Click **"Add file"** → **"Create new file"**
3. Name it exactly: `package.json`
4. Paste the code above
5. Click **"Commit changes"**

